2
00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:39.820
<b>Conflict at the Summit</b>

3
00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.040
It's a tsunami!

4
00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:04.900
What power! He truly is a legendary monster!

5
00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.960
Aokiji...

6
00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.300
Young fool!

7
00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.930
H-He stopped it!

8
00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.010
Oh, my...

9
00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.400
He froze the entire bay!

10
00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.070
It's impossible for the ships to move!

11
00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.570
Fire!

12
00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.840
Destroy the Moby Dick!

13
00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.180
Now, let's go!

14
00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.850
We've got some solid ground to stand on!

15
00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.620
Show them what we can do!

16
00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:38.460
The division commanders have joined the fight! Don't stop attacking!

17
00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:44.360
How nice of them to freeze the ocean!

18
00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.530
I was so fired up that it was getting too hot for me!

19
00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.270
Guess it won't be that easy...

20
00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.970
The vice admirals of Navy HQ are here, too!

21
00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:05.830
I've never seen so many of the vice admirals together in one place!

22
00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.990
It's just like a Buster Call!

23
00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:15.390
But when they're up against the Old Man, or us, they're nothing special!

24
00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.770
Tsuru-san, stand back!

25
00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:22.200
Don't be ridiculous, youngsters!

26
00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:28.510
Even if I retreated to the ends of the sea, there's no such thing as a safe place anymore.

27
00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:33.240
Ground the ship on the frozen bay!

28
00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.810
Take 'em all down!

29
00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:39.150
Our destination is the bay! Advance!

30
00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.350
For the Old Man, I'd gladly sacrifice my own life!

31
00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.570
Bring it on, Navy HQ!

32
00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:48.290
Let's go, Squard Pirates!

33
00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.700
Yeah!

34
00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:55.130
It has finally begun.

35
00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.270
What's this? You're gonna fight now?

36
00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.420
I merely wish to measure...

37
00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.470
to see for myself...

38
00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:22.170
the true distance between us and that man.

39
00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.190
That's dangerous!

40
00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.000
Run away!

41
00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.820
Old Man!

42
00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:14.190
He stopped it... The most powerful slash in the world!

43
00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.630
The commander of the Third Division...

44
00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.180
Diamond Jozu!

45
00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:50.490
K-Kizaru is here!

46
00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.520
Hey, now. That's really bright, you know.

47
00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.450
He deflected an admiral's attack?

48
00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.400
What?

49
00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:25.570
He's covered in blue flames!

50
00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.280
Blue flames?

51
00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.200
You can't just...

52
00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.820
go straight for...

53
00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.060
the King, you know!

54
00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.940
You Whitebeard Pirates sure are scary!

55
00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.520
What's with his body?

56
00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.490
He took Kizaru-san's attack head-on, yet he's still alive!

57
00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.940
His ability is as powerful as the rumors said!

58
00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:01.720
A power even more rare than the Logia Fruits...

59
00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:05.130
The Mythical Zoan Type.

60
00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.500
Look! His wounds are disappearing!

61
00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.050
I don't believe this! How could that attack not work!?

62
00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:15.520
It still hurts.

63
00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:24.260
Liar.

64
00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:36.180
That's the First Division Commander!

65
00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:40.060
No matter what hits him, he recovers by flame...

66
00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.340
Marco the Phoenix!

67
00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:49.110
I've never seen a bird like this before...

68
00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:03.550
Hmm... this really hurts.

69
00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:05.300
Liar!

70
00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.480
Kizaru-san!

71
00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.600
Giant unit! Watch out for attacks coming from the sky, too!

72
00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.770
Sure!

73
00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.830
The Giants are coming!

74
00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.550
Aim for their legs! Bring them down!

75
00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:36.680
You guys, stand back!

76
00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:38.160
Jozu!

77
00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.060
What power!

78
00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.160
What's he doing?

79
00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.800
Try stopping this!

80
00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.820
It's a block of ice!

81
00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:18.560
It's way too big!

82
00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.680
I swear, those two are just...

83
00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:24.810
They simply went and left their stations!

84
00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:30.530
If we're not here...

85
00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.480
who will protect this area?!

86
00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:02.880
That enormous ice-block...

87
00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.940
He completely vaporized it!

88
00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:09.090
This is bad!

89
00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.370
Volcanic rocks!

90
00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.540
We can't let them hit us!

91
00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:19.970
Damn bastard!

92
00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:25.460
One of our ships has been hit!

93
00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.560
Get away from the ships!

94
00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:41.100
It's like watching the end of the world!

95
00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.720
These flames are too flashy.

96
00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:13.090
Why don't you go light some candles on a birthday cake instead, magma-brat?

97
00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:19.280
You don't like flashy funerals, Whitebeard?

98
00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.680
Advance towards the plaza!

99
00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.620
Fire! Don't stop!

100
00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.800
Don't hesitate!

101
00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:53.490
Advance towards the plaza!

102
00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.160
Stop the commanders!

103
00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:14.350
Don't let them reach the shore!

104
00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.920
Sink the Moby Dick! Kill Whitebeard!

105
00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.200
Here he comes!

106
00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.510
Fire!

107
00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.300
Break through the blockade of warships!

108
00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.000
Ace-kun!

109
00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.680
Alright, go!

110
00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.380
Little Oars Jr.!

111
00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.540
He's the descendant of the Continent-Puller, Oars!

112
00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:33.180
He's enormous! Far larger than an ordinary Giant!

113
00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:37.770
Don't let him into the bay! He's trying to breach our defenses!

114
00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:45.740
So, Oars's descendant is one of Whitebeard's men?

115
00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:51.210
I want him! I want his corpse!

116
00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.580
I'm starting to get excited!

117
00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.780
Oars!

118
00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:07.400
Ace-kun is a nice guy!

119
00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:12.340
I ain't lettin' ya kill him!
